  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [
    "This table lists the study-specific biological-age score components supplied in the cleaned analytical dataset. It is provided for variable definition and transparency and should be interpreted as study-specific. hs-CRP, high-sensitivity C-reactive protein; MCV, mean corpuscular volume; HbA1c, glycated haemoglobin; BUN, blood urea nitrogen; ALP, alkaline phosphatase; RDW, red cell distribution width."
